    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "962b58005546c945",
      "translationZh": "我构建了 SkillMeter——一个面向 Agent Skills（SKILL.md 包）的开放评估层。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7585fcd1c11ecee8",
      "translationZh": "背景：skills.sh 负责技能发现，agentskills.io 负责格式标准，但对于“这个技能在你的智能体上是否好用、安全、可移植？”这个问题，仍然没有公开且可复现的答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8787009f8e7408ec",
      "translationZh": "功能：- 31 条确定性规则（不使用 LLM，离线运行，通常耗时 <1s）- 评分维度：规范符合度、质量、安全性（7 类威胁；严重威胁 → 一票否决，评级为 F）、可移植性、token 成本 - CLI：sb check path/to/skill",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df0ac68a0b47a0b5",
      "translationZh": "首次对 59 个真实技能进行评估（平均分 85.8）。采用 MIT 许可证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90a32347024b1257",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/DoTrungHuy/skillmeter",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdf1e35b2966f4c4",
      "translationZh": "欢迎反馈误报问题或对规则设计提出意见。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
